  "description": "2S 20A lithium battery protection board with balancing (HW-391 REV 1.2, sold as AITRIP B08NSTF8CT). 20 A continuous discharge, 10 A charge, 25 A trip, charge 8.4-9.0 V, overcharge detect 4.2-4.3 V, over-discharge 2.3-2.6 V, short-circuit protection auto-recovers in about 200 ms, balance at about 4.2 V / 100 mA, quiescent current below 18 uA. Five plated-through wire-solder pads: 0V (B-), 4.2V (BM, cell midpoint), 8.4V (B+), P- and P+ (charge/discharge output). 0V and P- are different nets (the MOSFETs sit between them).",
